          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Header (spec 4 Amendment 1): Save revision is the explicit save; drafts autosave. Submit to community appears only for a saved revision, and spec 6 decides its gating (M). Drafts are never shared (L). Test in practice opens guided-practice setup with the latest saved revision; nothing starts or charges until Start, and there is no fixed-length test (R).",
