          "content": "Single zero, inside minimum 1 (spec 1). The one-spin table shows only while the plan is one fixed layout (Flat bet). Its pockets, probabilities and amounts are exact, engine-computed rules facts, and it is hidden once a progression or multi-spin rule exists. No average or expected result per spin (Q).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TTLbr",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Progression templates are only the built-in catalog's (capped Martingale, three-win parlay, bounded Labouchere), copied with their caps. Each carries spec 3's statement that changing stakes doesn't remove the house edge. No D'Alembert (U).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vlcak",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Stopping rules are cycle-scoped (S). Header (spec 4 Amendment 1): Save revision is the explicit save; drafts autosave. Submit to community appears only for a saved revision, and spec 6 decides its gating (M). Drafts are never shared (L). Test in practice opens guided-practice setup with the latest saved revision; nothing starts or charges until Start, and there is no fixed-length test (R).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RNh8T",
          "name": "Annotation",
          "fill": "$--annotation",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Strategy note: the author's own prose, labelled as theirs, shown after a correction apart from the coach's explanation, never during Check, and never changes behaviour (T).",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
